The records the hops in between found are not returned, and neither are repeats, so a path says which records it ended on rather than which of the records before them led there. Walking from a post to its comments and back lands on the post it started from.

```elixir
Blog.load_many(posts, [:comments, :post])
```

<!-- livebook:{"output":true} -->

```

13:49:18.617 [info] list Comment by [:post_id] for 10 rows

13:49:18.636 [info] list Post by [:id] for 10 rows
```

